{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund more NHS Dental Services for people on lower incomes",
        "additional_details": "We believe the prices at private dentist are just too much for so many people. We need help with regards to being able to access NHS dental services. I was on the waiting list for 8 years with no luck. We need help from the Government to fund dental services across the nation.",
        "background": "I have just got a cost from a private dentist to improve my teeth at a cost of \u00a32100 this is unavoidable at a time when the cost of living is so high. We need more NHS dental services for working class people & people on lower incomes.",
